<section aria-labelledby="course-map-heading" class="relative z-10 bg-sand text-charcoal" id="course-map"><div class="relative lg:h-[100svh] lg:min-h-[640px] lg:overflow-hidden"><div class="grid gap-10 px-5 py-20 sm:px-8 lg:h-full lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-10 lg:px-12 lg:pb-8 lg:pt-20"><div class="flex flex-col lg:col-span-4 lg:justify-between lg:py-2"><div><p class="flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-charcoal/70"><span class="tabular-nums">02</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px w-8 bg-current opacity-40"></span><span>The course</span></p><h2 class="mt-6 text-[clamp(2.1rem,3.6vw,3.4rem)] font-light leading-[1.02] tracking-[-0.03em]" id="course-map-heading">Eighteen holes. <em class="font-serif font-normal">One unbroken walk.</em></h2><p class="mt-5 max-w-sm text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal/70 lg:short:hidden">The routing heads out along the coast, climbs through the pines and turns for home across the heath.<span class="hidden lg:inline"> Keep scrolling to walk it hole by hole.</span><span class="lg:hidden"> Choose a hole to fly to it.</span></p></div><div aria-live="polite" class="mt-10 lg:mt-6"><div class="animate-in fade-in slide-in-from-bottom-3 duration-700 ease-out"><div class="flex items-end gap-5"><span class="font-serif text-[clamp(4rem,6vw,6.25rem)] leading-[0.78] tracking-[-0.02em] text-forest">01</span><div class="pb-1"><p class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-charcoal/55">Hole <!-- -->1<!-- --> of 18</p><h3 class="type-wide mt-1 text-[clamp(1.35rem,2vw,1.8rem)] font-medium uppercase leading-tight">Threshold</h3></div></div><dl class="mt-6 grid grid-cols-3 border-y border-charcoal/15"><div class="py-3"><dt class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-charcoal/55">Par</dt><dd class="type-wide mt-1 text-xl font-medium tabular-nums">4</dd></div><div class="py-3 border-l border-charcoal/15 pl-4"><dt class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-charcoal/55">Yards</dt><dd class="type-wide mt-1 text-xl font-medium tabular-nums">402</dd></div><div class="py-3 border-l border-charcoal/15 pl-4"><dt class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-charcoal/55">Stroke index</dt><dd class="type-wide mt-1 text-xl font-medium tabular-nums">9</dd></div></dl><p class="mt-5 min-h-[4.5rem] max-w-md text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal/75">A wide, welcoming fairway that falls toward the heath. Hold the left side for the best look at a green open at the front.</p></div></div><div class="mt-8 lg:mt-6"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4"><p class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-charcoal/55">Choose a hole</p><div class="flex gap-2"><button class="flex size-9 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-charcoal/20 transition-colors hover:border-charcoal hover:bg-charcoal hover:text-bone" type="button"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-arrow-left size-4" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="m12 19-7-7 7-7"></path><path d="M19 12H5"></path></svg><span class="sr-only">Previous hole</span></button><button class="flex size-9 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-charcoal/20 transition-colors hover:border-charcoal hover:bg-charcoal hover:text-bone" type="button"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right size-4" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg><span class="sr-only">Next hole</span></button></div></div><div aria-label="Holes one to eighteen" class="mt-3 grid grid-cols-9 gap-1.5" role="group"><button aria-label="Hole 1, Threshold, par 4, 402 yards" aria-pressed="true" class="flex